# D3-SU-001: A neighbouring metal can protect iron or leave it anodic
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 NaCl 0.005mol
add v1 Fe 0.001mol
add v1 Zn 0.001mol
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 NaCl 0.005mol
add v2 Fe 0.001mol
add v2 Cu 0.001mol
add v3 water 50mL
add v3 NaCl 0.005mol
add v3 Fe 0.001mol
seal v1 500mL
seal v2 500mL
seal v3 500mL
add v1 O2 0.003mol
add v2 O2 0.003mol
add v3 O2 0.003mol
wait 48h
look v1
look v2
look v3
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
